Paikar hai yeh kaisi haye Sughra meri.<br>
<br>
Baap se milne ki arzu rehgayi,<br>
Hijr me hi margaye haye Sughra meri.<br>
<br>
Paas Akbar nahi nanhe Asghar nahi,<br>
Quld me ja basi haye Sughra meri.<br>
<br>
Mere Sajjad ka zakhm sukha na tha,<br>
Daagh ye degayi haye Sughra meri.<br>
<br>
Kookh bhi jal gayi maang ujdi meri,<br>
Mai na kyu margayi haye Sughra meri.<br>
<br>
Haye kya hogaya bolti kyu nahi,<br>
Maa se yeh beruqi haye Sughra meri.<br>
<br>
Woh Sakina meri qaid me chal basi,<br>
Yaad hai tashnagi haye Sughra meri.<br>
<br>
